Smaller C/C++ differences between MWCC and clang: __declspec(section)
spelled through DECL_SECTION, pointer arithmetic between different
pointer types (JKRSolidHeap), va_end with its argument, the JKRFile
assert macro's argument list, a pointer-to-enum cast through int
(SequenceApp), `#line` numbers in decimal (ItemObj), and an anonymous
union around a struct array that clang's C++03 mode rejects
(SequenceInfo).

